### A licensure exam: where the reading runs out

::: {.callout-tip appearance="simple"}
**Recall** from [Response time and the speed-accuracy tradeoff](response-time.qmd): on this exam's 170 scored items the median response takes 54 s, and responses slower than expected are less often right.
